dels \nPoly - Lobby Music \nContributors! for the good ideas like some maps or towers!","path":"/game/5961054350-floppa-tower-defense","slug":"5961054350-floppa-tower-defense","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d9475b90bcd2294a448306b67376cc38a0b610ee89253245c1e2cfaa059eb294.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-53ccf10b09c4e0b67b5210106101bd53/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":9135700,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-04T19:55:07.743Z","creator":{"name":"ramielzs","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5977280685,"name":"Ninja Legends 2","desc":"Welcome to Ninja Legends 2! Master your parkour skills and become the ultimate Ninja!\r\n\r\n💨 Double-tap your jump button to Double Jump! (PC = Spacebar, Mobile = Jump Button, Xbox = 'A' Button)\r\n\r\n✨ Premium Benefits: x2 Training Area Boosts, x2 Chest Rewards, +1 Daily Fortune Spin, +1 Pet Slot\r\n\r\n🎁 Join Scriptbloxian Studios to unlock the group rewards chest in-game! https://www.roblox.com/groups/4705120/Scriptbloxian-Studios","path":"/game/5977280685-ninja-legends-2","slug":"5977280685-ninja-legends-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ae2f235f6562f3377ad48d2e4c1fb76511e5f6ad84f9bf3821c256a4bd71e536.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e97104adac67b30ec5a9485a532df88a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":170314516,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-14T22:33:39.153Z","creator":{"name":"Scriptbloxian Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":7,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6085581583,"name":"[🎉RELEASE] Project Hero","desc":"❗ The game is still in beta and may have bugs. Notify bugs in the server below!\r\n\r\nProject Hero is a manga-inspired game known as \"My Hero Academia\" with a superhero society with 80% of the world possessing an uncanny ability! Become a hero or villain to explore and battle with anime themed powers!\r\n\r\nInformation and more : (Join the dis f